  "prefLabel": "Env-Hw 206.01 Rulemaking Petitions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Hw 206.01 Rulemaking Petitions. Any person may petition the commissioner to amend or repeal any provision in the hazardous waste rules in accordance with Env-C 207 and 40 CFR 260.20.\n\nSource. #9361-B, eff 1-28-09; ss by #12344-A, eff 8-14-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-hw200.html"
